{
  "dialogue": {
    "Hello, what is this place?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Welcome to our dog shelter! I'm Talia and I run it alongside my husband, Chase.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "You don't seem to have many dogs. Where are the rest?": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "I wish I could tell you they'd all been adopted... but I'd be lying to myself.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 611
    },
    "So they were never here to begin with?": {
      "expression": 13951
    },
    "No.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "We're trying. The monks from the Monastery believe in our cause. That's why they granted us this land.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 611
    },
    "But belief, sadly, won't help keep us open.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 610
    },
    "What would you need to keep the shelter open?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "We need more strays to rescue. If people know they can find a companion here, they'll come.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "Can't you go out to look for strays then?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "We tried.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 610
    },
    "What happened?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "It can take one of us hours just to coerce a puppy out of hiding.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 611
    },
    "And the shelter doesn't run itself.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "By the time we got back, we'd still need to clean the kennels, feed the dogs we do have, repair the fences...": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Plus, there was no one to keep the cats and dogs separate.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "I thought this was a dog shelter?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Not always.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "What we really need is someone worldly who can bring strays back for us.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Lucky for you, I enjoy wandering.": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "I can smell it.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "So you'll help us out?": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "I'd be happy to. Any ideas where I could start?": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "We've met so many people that might be able to...": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Gertrude.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Yes, Gertrude! She was a great help with the cats.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Not much for dogs.": {
      "head": 16488,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Right, but I'm sure she can point you in the right direction. You'll find her house near the western entrance to Varrock.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 569
    },
    "Excellent idea. I've helped her out before. I can check in with her.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Wonderful! Good luck!": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Hello there, Gertrude.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Hello, adventurer! How can I help you today?": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "I've come to ask a favour, if you don't mind?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Of course, anything for the hero who returned Fluffs to me.": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Talia sent me to you. She said you helped them with their dog shelter?": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "It's just a dog shelter now? I don't blame them... They had trouble keeping the cats and dogs separate. How have they been getting on?": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 556
    },
    "Not well. They barely have any dogs in for adoption.": {
      "expression": 610
    },
    "Oh dear... I suppose that's why you're here?": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 13980
    },
    "Precisely! They thought you might know of some dogs in the city I could rescue.": {
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "Well, it would be nice for someone to do something about those mangy stray dogs you see in Varrock.": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "I wouldn't call them mangy... They just need some love.": {
      "expression": 611
    },
    "They're covered in fleas and they're everywhere. They always beg for food when I walk through the city.": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Sounds like the kind of rescue Talia would be looking for...": {
      "expression": 13980
    },
    "I'd be happy to see them go. I always see them near the west entrance to the city.": {
      "head": 3500,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "I'll start my search there then. You've been a great help!": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Woof woof!": {
      "head": 16498,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Easy girl! Calm down!": {
      "head": 16491,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "What's going on here?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "I have no idea. She just started barking at me.": {
      "head": 16491,
      "expression": 596
    },
    "Bark bark bark!": {
      "head": 16504,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Something has her upset. Has she ever been like this before?": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "No, normally she's very friendly, although we haven't seen her for a few weeks...": {
      "head": 16491,
      "expression": 597
    },
    "Whatever it is, she is being very persistent.": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Maybe she wants one of us to follow her. I can't leave my post. Could you go?": {
      "head": 16491,
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Arf arf!": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Hmm... This is the kind of situation Talia would have me intervene with...": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Of course I can! Where did you want to go, girl?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "You'd better be quick! She's already on the move.": {
      "head": 16491,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "I think I'm starting to understand what's got you so upset.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Whimper.": {
      "head": 16497,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "It appears some puppies were playing here at one point...": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Mrrph...": {
      "head": 16497,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "But they're gone now and you don't seem too happy about it.": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Woof.": {
      "head": 16497,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "What's wrong? Have you caught their scent?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Grrrrr...": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "What is it, girl?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Bark bark.": {
      "head": 16500,
      "expression": 610
    },
    "Hey, is that one of your puppies?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Uh oh! Big dog!": {
      "head": 16534,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "A goblin?!": {
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Picklenose think Picklenose go now.": {
      "head": 16534,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Hang on, get back here!": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Yes of course, let's get you out of danger first, little guy.": {
      "expression": 568
    },
    "We arrived at the right time.": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Arf!": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "Are there any more puppies we need to find?": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Let's go find them then! Follow me!": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "What mean Picklenose lose other dog?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Picklenose jumped by big dog.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 596
    },
    "How big?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Bigger than Nosorog.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Ooh, big big! Toetaller understand now.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Bark bark!": {
      "head": 16505,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Ahem!": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Hello, human. What you want?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "There! Big dog!": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 596
    },
    "This dog?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "Woof!": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Yes.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 596
    },
    "It not big as Nosorog... Picklenose lie.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "It bigger before.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Toetaller doubt that.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Picklenose not lie! Dog bigger before.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Excuse me!": {
      "expression": 13965
    },
    "Human rude. Goblins busy. Speak quick.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Why did you steal these puppies? You need to give them back.": {
      "expression": 615
    },
    "Sorry, human. We have big plan. Keep village safe.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Puppies will keep your village safe?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Silly human.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 605
    },
    "Very silly. Puppy too weak. We wait 'till puppy big, strong.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 606
    },
    "Big, strong, scary dog keep village safe.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "You're just going to wait here till the puppy is fully grown?": {
      "expression": 576
    },
    "Yes. Not take long Toetaller think.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "I'm afraid puppies don't work like that.": {
      "expression": 605
    },
    "What human mean?": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "You know you have to feed dogs to keep them alive?": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "No...": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "They also have a lot of energy they need to burn off.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "How do that?": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "You need to play with them, take them for walks...": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "That sound boring.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 562
    },
    "I wouldn't expect a dog to sit and guard your village all day either.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Why not?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "It's a dog. It needs attention and caring for. It won't just sit still for hours.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Hmm...": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "Maybe a guard dog isn't the best idea?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "No, Toetaller still want guard dog. We make this one guard dog without all that.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "If you don't feed it, it will die.": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Toetaller don't think so.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Picklenose have idea.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Oh, here we go...": {
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Human find goblins dog that no need all that... extra stuff, then goblins give human this useless dog.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "I don't think a dog like that exists...": {
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "Then we do goblin plan.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Wait, wait! Could I make you something?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Picklenose no know, can you?": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "Maybe I could make something with some fur...?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Remember dog need be big... huge!": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Yes, huge and scary. Defend village from outsiders.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "... Then I suppose I'd need to stuff it with something, maybe grain...?": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Dog intimidate invaders, save goblin lives.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Human even listen to goblins now?": {
      "head": 16521,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 554
    },
    "More like Picklenose not worth listening to.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "... Then a needle and thread to put it together...": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Okay, I think I can make something better for you.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Human be quick. Goblins low attention span.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Human has returned.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Finally. Picklenose bored waiting.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 562
    },
    "Toetaller no see huge dog?": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 575
    },
    "Human own idea fail?": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 605
    },
    "No no, I have them right here.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "So, what do you think?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "That's big dog...": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Village never attacked again with this dog guarding.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Toetaller accept trade, no takesies backsies. Human promise.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "I promise.": {
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Good. Toetaller no want human show up to village and cry in front of Generals.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "You have my word. Here...": {
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "...": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13959
    },
    "Are you two okay?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Goblins amazed at size of big dog.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "Very big.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 13958
    },
    "Toetaller have idea.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "General Toetaller and General Picklenose have good ring to them.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "Nobody stop us with big dog on our side.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Human, you do good. Goblins return to village heroes.": {
      "head": 16522,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "You allowed visit village, see dog if want.": {
      "head": 16521,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Oh, that's very kind of you. Thank you.": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "They're finally gone. Come with us, little guy. We'll keep you safe.": {
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Great! That's two puppies saved. Is that all of them?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "I'm inclined to believe that's a no. Any clue where they could be?": {
      "expression": 555
    },
    "Look what we got 'ere.": {
      "head": 16535,
      "expression": 592
    },
    "A little mangy mutt. Can we keep 'em?": {
      "head": 16536,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 592
    },
    "For now, but don't get too attached. Heard tale some folk down in Morytania buy 'em when they're fully grown.": {
      "head": 16535,
      "expression": 594
    },
    "What do they use 'em for?": {
      "head": 16536,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 592
    },
    "Not for us to know. All I care about is the runes they'll give us.": {
      "head": 16535,
      "expression": 13963
    },
    "Runes? We can sell them for a good bit of coin.": {
      "head": 16536,
      "side": "right",
      "expression": 13963
    },
    "Oi, leave that puppy alone!": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Grrr!": {
      "head": 16505,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Who are you?": {
      "head": 16535,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "We're here to save that puppy.": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "We found 'em first. They're ours.": {
      "head": 16536,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Not on my watch.": {
      "expression": 614
    },
    "You'll 'av to take 'em from us.": {
      "head": 16535,
      "expression": 13963
    },
    "Are you okay, little guy? Did they hurt you?": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Looks like you're all in one piece. Let's get you somewhere safe.": {
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Is that all of them?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "That was a close call. That's the second time we got lucky and arrived just in time.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "We can't let something like that happen again. I can take you and your puppies somewhere safe, if you'd like?": {
      "expression": 556
    },
    "Mmm?": {
      "head": 16502,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "It's not far from here. Follow me.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "You seem enthusiastic enough. Let's head out.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Talia, Chase! I have returned.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Adventurer! Who's this beautiful girl you've got with you?": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "I found her in Varrock. She's one of the stray dogs.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Poor girl.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "We've been on quite the adventure together.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Really? What happened?": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "When I found her, she was distraught. Her puppies had been stolen.": {
      "expression": 611
    },
    "Who would do such a thing?": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 614
    },
    "Goblins.": {
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Fair enough.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "But we managed to save them all!": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Oh my goodness!": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 571
    },
    "Quite the selection.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13968
    },
    "Cute, aren't they.": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Oh Chase, this is exactly what we need to keep the shelter going!": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Are you sure they want to stay with us?": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "I'm pretty sure that means yes at this point.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Wonderful, you will all be happy and safe here!": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Arf arf.": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "What's the matter, girl?": {
      "expression": 571
    },
    "She's not staying.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "I don't think she likes it here...": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 610
    },
    "It's okay girl, you'll be safe here and well cared for.": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Whine.": {
      "head": 16530,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "I don't think you'll be able to convince her, she's quite stubborn.": {
      "expression": 589
    },
    "I like her already.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13954
    },
    "What kind of shelter would we be if we let a dog stay as a stray?": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 611
    },
    "I might be able to help with that.": {
      "head": 16539,
      "expression": 588
    },
    "I'm one of the Varrock guards. We've grown fond of this old girl.": {
      "head": 16539,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "I'd say she's happy to see you.": {
      "expression": 588
    },
    "Would you be willing to adopt her for us?": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 554
    },
    "She's proven her bravery, we'd be delighted to bring her into our ranks.": {
      "head": 16539,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "Thank you! We'll get you set up with some things for her, free of charge!": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Free?": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "It's the least we can do.": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Thank you, adventurer, this is just what the shelter needed!": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "I do my best.": {
      "expression": 13968
    },
    "If you would ever like to adopt one of these puppies yourself, just talk to Chase and he'll help you out.": {
      "head": 16537,
      "expression": 589
    },
    "For a small fee.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "After all I've done?": {
      "expression": 1182
    },
    "Business is business.": {
      "head": 16538,
      "expression": 13956
    },
    "Thank you once again, adventurer. You've really given us hope to keep going.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Happy to help!": {
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Wonderful, because our work has just begun!": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 567
    },
    "Huh?": {
      "expression": 575
    },
    "Word has spread of our shelter and we've received letters about stray dogs across the world.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "Chase has been keeping a log of all the reports. If you speak with him, he'll show you.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 568
    },
    "What's in it for me?": {
      "expression": 554
    },
    "Well, you'll be able to adopt any puppies you bring back.": {
      "head": 16486,
      "expression": 589
    }
